WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.091
Every week in Toronto, believers ask the same question: who can we trust to do the work?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.300
Jubilee is Toronto’s Christian marketplace.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.901
Every business is Christian-owned, and vouched for by a pastor.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.455
Members find a business, message it, book a meeting or ask for a quote, then pay the business directly.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.200
Two hundred founding businesses open the beta on February first.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.746
Everyone else joins on April sixth, 2027.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.474
A basic listing is free, forever.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.700
Plus is $29 a month. Pro, $79.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.010
Founding businesses get Plus free for a year.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.200
In September, homes arrive: rooms, apartments and sublets.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.882
Free for renters. Landlords pay $39 a listing.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.154
In May 2028, short-term and monthly stays follow,

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.653
booked and paid through Jubilee, for an eleven percent fee.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:02.619
Revenue grows to $3.1 million by 2031. We break even in 2030.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.043
We’re raising a $750,000 pre-seed.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:11.910
Next come Jubilee Pay, events, and cities beyond Toronto.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.023
Jubilee. Your community is open for business.
